<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Westwood One started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Westwood One started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alex Brown said on Tuesday it began coverage of Westwood One Inc with a strong buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Westwood's shares were up 1/8 at 31-3/8.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
